    \textbf{Findings 6: On GPT2-XL-1.5B, under the full-model setup, \name{}-family consistently performs well, while Muon diverges. Particularly, \arosink{} gives the best and robust performance under full model setup, outperforming the Muon$+$Adam-hybrid; while other base optimizers show various limitations. This result reveals the importance of both \name{} rotation, as well as choosing base optimizer wisely.}
\end{findings}

