    \multirow{2}{*}{CH}   & Mass conservation  & $\ddt M = 0$ \\[2pt]
                          & Energy dissipation & $\ddt E_0 = - \la m(\phi)\nabla\mu,\nabla\mu \ra \le 0$ \\
    \addlinespace
    \multirow{2}{*}{CHD}  & Mass conservation  & $\ddt M = 0$ \\
