Disjoint union of paths &  $G$ and $H$'s adjacency matrices have the same multisets of main eigenvalues \cite{cerny2025homomorphismindistinguishabilitymultiplicityautomata} & Exact Logspace \cite{cerny2025homomorphismindistinguishabilitymultiplicityautomata} \\ 
