    \begin{theorem}\label{Hardy-Type I} Let $N \geq 2$, $p > 1$ and suppose that $W$ satisfies $(W_0)$ and $(W_1^+)$. Then, for any function $u \in C_0^\infty(\mathbb{R}^N)$,
		the following inequality holds 
		
