			\int_{\mathbb{R}^N_+} W_{x_N}(x_N)|u|^pdx+p	\int_{\mathbb{R}^{N-1}}  W(0)|u|^{p}dx'\leq p^p\int_{\mathbb{R}^{N}_+} \frac{W^p}{[W_{x_N}]^{p-1}} |\nabla u|^pdx.
		\end{equation}
		In particular, if $u \in C_0^\infty(\mathbb{R}^N_+)$, we infer that
