where  $\mathbb{W}^{\epsilon,k,j,\H}$ (resp. $\mathbb{W}^{k,j,\H}$) denotes the 2nd level of the rough path associated with $\Lambda_\epsilon^k(W^{k,\H})$ (resp. $W^{k,\H}$), for $j=k$. Instead, if $j\neq k$
\begin{align*}
