$t_{ij}$ & Travel time between nodes $i \in N,j \in N$.
    & $y_i^k$ & Battery level upon arrival at node $i \in N$. \\

  $e_i$ & Earliest start of service or charging at node $i \in N$.
    & $Y_i^k$ & Battery level upon departure from node $i \in N$. \\

$l_i$ & Latest start of service or charging at node $i \in N$.
& $p_i^k$ & Arrival time of vehicle $k \in K$ at node $i \in N$. \\

$s_i$ & Service time at node $i \in N$.
  & $x_{ij}^k$ & Binary variable equal to 1 if vehicle $k \in K$ travels\\

