The domain $\Omega$ is defined by
$\Omega=c\{1.5z+0.4z^3\mid |z|\le1\}$ with the constant $c$ chosen so that the length of the boundary curve is equal to $2\pi$.
In other words, $\widetilde\Phi(z)=1.5z+0.4z^3$ for the function mentioned at the beginning of the current section.
