we could also define
the following weighted norm
\begin{equation}
 \sum_{I,J} \left( \sum_{n=1}^\infty 2^{nsp} \Vert \psi(2^n.)W \Vert_{\mathcal{W}^{\alpha,p}_{r,2^{-n}I} \mathcal{W}^{\alpha,p}_{\theta,2^{-n}J} }^p \right)^{\frac{1}{p}}
\end{equation}
