Then setting $T=T_11_{\square_1} +  T_21_{\square_2}$ gives us the desired candidate. However the reader must beware that the glued object $T$ is still $\alpha$--H\"older in $r$ but no longer of regularity $\alpha-1$--H\"older in the $\theta$ variable along the interface $\theta=0$ since there might be some jump after gluing. 
