     &= \frac{1}{2\sqrt{\pi \epsilon t}} \int_0^\infty e^{-\frac{1}{2 \epsilon}[\frac{(x-\xi)^2}{2t}+\int_{0}^\xi u_0 (y) dy]} d \xi-\frac{1}{2\sqrt{\pi \epsilon t}} \int_0^\infty e^{-\frac{1}{2 \epsilon}[\frac{(x+\xi)^2}{2t}+\int_{0}^\xi u_0 (y) dy]} d \xi\\
