      & +\frac{x}{(4 \pi \epsilon)^{\frac{3}{2}}} \int_0^t \int_0^\tau \int_0^1 \int_{0}^{\infty}
      \frac{\xi}{ u^{\frac{1}{2}} (\tau-u)^{\frac{3}{2}}(t-\tau)^{\frac{3}{2}}}
