\lim_{p \to \infty} \frac{V^*(t; \lambda)}{p} = \lim_{p \to \infty} \sum_{m=1}^M \left(\frac{1}{p} \sum_{i=1}^{p} t_{V_m}(\hat{\beta}_i, \beta_i)\right) \xrightarrow{P} \sum_{m=1}^M \mathbb{E}[t_{V_m}(\eta_{\alpha \tau}(\Pi + \tau Z), \Pi)].
